Sharana the Illusive
By Noble
Long ago I met Sharana, I was very impressed with her interactivity so decided
  to visit with her again and give you a report on her activities in Leowons'
  forest so I went to Leowons' forest and found Lorn the Bard and asked him
  about her and this is what he said to me.
Lorn says: She wanders these lands sometimes, keeping an eye out for evils
trying to strike root here, and weeds them out if she finds any. Never was
  there a more graceful creature in these lands than she.
With the information Lorn gave me I began my evening search knowing you only
  see her at night, alas I was unsuccessful but maybe you will have better
  luck. I'm sure you will be delighted with her spontaneous nature, but rest
  assured she can defend herself if provoked.
